%Name = "Pool Party"
%MapFile = "Pool.map"

%LevelBriefing = "POOL PARTY

Welcome to your first mission.

This abandoned pool complex is where you will begin your hospital management career. 
Turn this limited space into a male beauty clinic. Your main focus will be gluing hair onto bald guys. 
Make sure to charge accordingly.

You will need to build a GP's office, to check potential clients' credit score. Then you should make use of the Scanner, so you can 
check for any gold teeth and spare change. Finally you should install the Hair Restorer chair (also known as Fuzzy Gluer). You'll figure out the rest.

Best of luck, make a bunch of shiny scalps hairy again!"

%LevelDebriefing = "Good job! Your clinic really got popular and simply too small - 
shows you're ready to move onto something more spacious."

